，你可以建立一个高效、协作、积极的团队，为团队的成功打下坚实的基础。\n文心一言给的借鉴","like_count":1,"discussions":[{"author":{"id":1098920,"avatar":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/10/c4/a8/f2685e1b.jpg","nickname":"华仔","note":"","ucode":"851FF94CF5133A","race_medal":0,"user_type":2,"is_pvip":false},"reply_author":{"id":0,"avatar":"","nickname":"","note":"","ucode":"","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"discussion":{"id":626692,"discussion_content":"这种大而全的回答不会有错，但也没什么用，管理不是对照操作手册从第一步开始做到第10步全部做完就搞定了这种  ：）","content_length":56,"likes_number":0,"is_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"ctime":1693282394,"is_liked":false,"can_delete":false,"is_complain":false,"is_top":true,"parent_id":0,"ip_address":"广东","group_id":0,"attachments":[]},"score":2,"extra":"{\"reply\":true,\"user_type\":2}","child_discussion_number":0,"child_discussions":[]}]},{"had_liked":false,"id":350763,"user_name":"怀揣梦想的学渣","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c1","uid":1916685,"ip_address":"","ucode":"2349B9F4F6FDE3","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/1d/3f/0d/1e8dbb2c.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1657179669,"is_pvip":false,"replies":[{"id":127618,"content":"技术人员中能够具备你这样业务思维的人太少了，大部分人宁愿把大把时间花在数据结构和算法的各种源码，或者去刷leetcode的题目 ：）","user_name":"作者回复","user_name_real":"编辑","uid":1098920,"ctime":1657184460,"ip_address":"","comment_id":350763,"utype":1}],"discussion_count":2,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":100064501,"comment_content":"十分赞同文中提到的提升业务能力，我是提升业务能力的受益者，客户提出一个需求，我会和客户沟通确认为何有这个需求，发现客户的本质需求是另一件事，并且很轻松就可以处理。如果只是满足客户直接的需求，不知道要忙到哪年，甚至可能难以实现。","like_count":1,"discussions":[{"author":{"id":1098920,"avatar":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/10/c4/a8/f2685e1b.jpg","nickname":"华仔","note":"","ucode":"851FF94CF5133A","race_medal":0,"user_type":2,"is_pvip":false},"reply_author":{"id":0,"avatar":"","nickname":"","note":"","ucode":"","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"discussion":{"id":579127,"discussion_content":"技术人员中能够具备你这样业务思维的人太少了，大部分人宁愿把大把时间花在数据结构和算法